WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:16.116
Kip walked along the sidewalk.

2
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:19.334
"Goose is Bird's friend," he said.

3
00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:22.210
"She's not my friend.

4
00:00:22.211 --> 00:00:31.050
She's too big and too loud."

5
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:39.316
Just then Kip saw something.

6
00:00:39.317 --> 00:00:44.273
A cat was sitting on a window ledge.

7
00:00:44.274 --> 00:00:47.679
"Meow!" said the cat.

8
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.970
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

9
00:00:52.971 --> 00:00:55.119
Kip started to run.

10
00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.958
The cat jumped after him.

11
00:00:57.959 --> 00:01:01.842
Kip ran as fast as he could.

12
00:01:01.843 --> 00:01:08.563
So did the cat.

13
00:01:08.564 --> 00:01:17.664
"Ah!" cried Kip.

14
00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:23.243
Suddenly Bird and Goose flew over to Kip.

15
00:01:23.244 --> 00:01:28.512
"There you are!" said Bird.

16
00:01:28.513 --> 00:01:30.769
Goose landed in front of the cat.

17
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:34.524
"Honk! Honk! Honk!" cried Goose.

18
00:01:34.525 --> 00:01:37.213
The cat got scared and ran away.

19
00:01:37.214 --> 00:01:41.695
"You saved me, Goose!" said Kip.

20
00:01:41.696 --> 00:01:44.263
"Thank you!"

21
00:01:44.264 --> 00:01:48.630
"Honk! You're Bird's friend," said Goose.

22
00:01:48.631 --> 00:01:53.141
"So you're my friend too."

23
00:01:53.142 --> 00:02:01.646
Kip was happy to have two good friends.

24
00:02:01.647 --> 00:02:05.411
"I like Goose," he thought.

25
00:02:05.412 --> 00:02:12.041
"It's good to have a big, loud friend!"
